  "description": "We have just purchased and completed this property. We were forwarded a letter from the selling agent regarding enforcement action to remove an existing unauthorised fence between our property and our neighbour, reference on letter is DP/PET/25/83925/M (Mr Paul Whelan is named as a contact on the letter).\n\nAlthough we have inherited this issue, we would like to retain the fence as it is and we are now making an official application to keep the fence as it is please. \n\nTherefore; DESCRIPTION OF PROPOSED WORKS: ERRECTION OF BOUNDRY FENCE (ALREADY ERECTED).\n\nPlease note that there have been serious issues reported about the next door basement flat. we were informed that there have been several disturbances of antisocial behaviour and recent police were called in to investigate. furthermore there has been a fire in there also. Considering the circumstances we feel that the  existing fence is important for us as it helps to maintain our privacy.",
